Output demo.gif
Output demo.mp4
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Hide
Type "clear" Enter
Show
Type "# tui — Clojure agent harness (MIT)" Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "clj -M:run" Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "Authenticating via OIDC passkey... http://localhost:8080/auth" Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "[+] verified (principal: azh***) — session JWT issued (8h)" Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "Prompt > git status + memory via gated tools" Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "All checks passed." Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "exit" Enter
